[size=5][b]Description[/b][/size]

The compatibility patches, bug fixes and additions made for [b]Zenderal[/b], the Enderal: Forgotten Stories Special Edition Wabbajack modlist, collected in one download.

Zenderal aims for three things: [b]bug fixes[/b], [b]modern combat[/b] and [b]modern visuals[/b]. A lot of the mods involved were never built to work together, or were made for Skyrim and only half work in Enderal. Each patch here fixes one of those gaps.

Built for Enderal SE 2.1 on engine 1.7.104 (Skyrim SE AE runtime). Most plugins are ESL-flagged.


[size=5][b]Installation instructions[/b][/size]

[b]Wabbajack users:[/b] nothing to do. Install Zenderal through Wabbajack and every patch is downloaded and placed for you.

[b]Manual install (MO2):[/b]
[list=1]
[*]Install the archive as one mod.
[*]Sort it after the mods it patches, both in the left pane and in the plugin load order.
[*]Untick any plugin whose required mods you don't have (see [b]Requirements[/b]).
[*]Load "Zenderal - 2.1 Levelsystem Cleanup" and "Zenderal - Unresolved References Cleanup" last.
[/list]


[size=5][b]Main features[/b][/size]

[size=4][b]Combat[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Chocolate Poise Enderal Fix:[/b] Chocolate Poise - Reforged deals zero poise damage in Enderal because it looks up vanilla Skyrim items Enderal doesn't have. Adds the reference items it needs, and makes Vatyr races harder to stagger.
[*][b]Chocolate Poise Faction Fix[/b] (SKSE plugin): stops Chocolate Poise - Reforged crashing the game on a poise break.
[*][b]FHR Parry Poise:[/b] For Honor Reforged parries actually stagger under Chocolate Poise (weapon parry 20 to 60, shield parry 5 to 40).
[*][b]MCO Directional Power Attacks:[/b] side, back and sprint power attacks, unarmed included, play For Honor Reforged's animations instead of Enderal's vanilla ones.
[*][b]Dynamic Dodge No Sway:[/b] dodging out of an attack plays the step dodge, not the on-the-spot sway.
[*][b]Dynamic Dodge Shot Fix:[/b] Dynamic Dodge Shot works in Enderal.
[*][b]Smooth Moveset NPC Idles and Menu Fix:[/b] NPCs stop replaying the combat-idle start whenever they move, and the move-stop animation no longer loops in menus.
[*][b]Faster Sprint:[/b] faster sprinting at half the stamina cost, for the player and NPCs, on top of EGO's values.
[*][b]Flintlock Overhaul:[/b] pistols fire craftable bullets and reload; NPCs carrying the gun mods' weapons get ammo; gun ammo turns up in loot.
[*][b]Flame Shot:[/b] the Fire Arrow talent becomes Flame Shot; with a musket it grants exploding Flame Musket Balls.
[*][b]Reversal Shadow:[/b] a black-and-silver pistol whose shot also casts Triumvirate's Witch Bolt; one lies on the shelf at Old Crosswatch. Plugin only - its mesh and sound come with the Zenderal list.
[*][b]Loop Pistol Animations and Quick Reload Stack:[/b] Loop's pistol animations win over the staff and moveset sets, and Quick Reload stacks with Rapid Shot.
[*][b]Lost One Archer Ammo:[/b] Lost One and skeleton archers carry enough arrows and keep fighting instead of hanging back.
[*][b]Lost Ones Dismembering:[/b] Dismembering Framework limbs for Lost Ones, skeletons, Enderal's wolves and minotaurs.
[*][b]SKSE plugins:[/b] Airborne Get-Up Fix (enemies no longer freeze mid-air after a ragdoll), Block Release Fix (no more stuck blocks with Dual Wield Parrying), Crossbow Draw Fix, DF SlowTime Guard, Musket Handling (muskets can't skip their reload with a dodge), OCPA Second Key, Key Trace (stance hotkeys on 1.7.104), and a Precision fork that stops Ice Elementals floating when hit.
[/list]

[size=4][b]Progression and balance[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Prophecy:[/b] a second set of talent trees - Faith, Sharpshooter, Gadgets, Martial Arts, Glory, Arcane Archery and Necromancy - opened from the Prophecy lesser power, with points earned as you level.
[*][b]Traits:[/b] 18 Enderal-specific traits in Biggie Traits' menu, and a fix for the empty trait menu on 1.7.104.
[*][b]Perk Overhaul:[/b] Blade Master and Replica reworked on top of EGO; Trickster archery perks mention muskets.
[*][b]Magic Patches:[/b] reprices Apocalypse and Triumvirate spells onto EGO's cost ladder, makes Triumvirate's self-heals cost Arcane Fever, and doubles weapon enchantment damage.
[*][b]Kata Fixes:[/b] merges the magic vendor chests several mods override, so no mod's stock is lost; removes KataPUMB pack 2's debug prompt and the 29 duplicated spells.
[*][b]KataPUMB Affinities 2.1:[/b] KataPUMB's 24 extra affinities work on Enderal 2.1.
[*][b]EGO 2.1 Compatibility:[/b] hides EGO's old playable races and gives Enderal 2.1's new ones Dark Souls Movement and Stamina's stats; fixes four invisible armour pieces.
[*][b]Pretty Armory EGO Patch:[/b] keeps every Pretty Armory mesh while restoring EGO's stats, prices, weights, keywords and NPC perks.
[*][b]Undead Creatures Replacer EGO Patch:[/b] keeps the new Lost One looks while restoring EGO's stats, perks and loot.
[*][b]Half Starling DS Races:[/b] a playable Half Starling profile matching the other Dark Souls Movement and Stamina races.
[*][b]Moonsteel Pretty Patch, Guard Falconer Patch, Fuse00 Armor Races:[/b] armour records restored over mods that reverted them.
[*][b]Zen Traits + Zen Traits Fixes:[/b] Shazdeh's Zen Traits, with Ambrosia reducing Arcane Fever again.
[*][b]NPC Potions[/b] (SPID): NPCs carry Enderal's restore potions as loot, banded by level.
[*][b]Sura Claymore Fix, Frost Spider Mother Fix, Fever Death Latch Fix:[/b] a duplicate shop entry, an invisible spider boss, and a stuck "dead" flag that could block every later level-up.
[/list]

[size=4][b]World, visuals and audio[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Ark Myrad Platform Fix, Ark Market Tree Fix, Ark Bridge Overhaul Fixes, Last Watch Trapdoor Fix, Old Cemetery Crypt Fix, Perpetuum Theater EVGAT Fix, EPPI Riverville Statues Patch and EPPI Riverville Cobble Removal:[/b] placement fixes around Ark and Riverville.
[*][b]RiverBush:[/b] 32 bushes in Riverville on top of EPPI Riverville.
[*][b]Terrain Texture Set Fix and Missing Parallax Heights:[/b] no more landscape streaks under ENB, and flat height maps for 289 parallax textures that shipped without one.
[*][b]2.1 Texture Rename Fix:[/b] SRP's normal maps at the names Enderal 2.1 renamed them to.
[*][b]Stump Ivy Patch:[/b] adjusted pine forest stump, log and hollow-trunk meshes.
[*][b]No Screen Flashes and Stances No Icon:[/b] no full-screen blur from enemy abilities or poison, and no stance icon above your head.
[*][b]Quieter Waterfalls:[/b] waterfalls and rapids 6 dB quieter on top of Reverb and Ambiance Overhaul; the coast wind near Ark fades in instead of switching on.
[*][b]Bloody Crit Sound and Silent Power Attack Grunts:[/b] a new critical-hit sound, and no power-attack yells from a female player.
[*][b]High Poly Player Head[/b] (SKSE plugin): your character uses High Poly Head's head; NPCs are untouched.
[*][b]2.1 Levelsystem Cleanup, Unresolved References Cleanup, Qyra Island EditorID Fix:[/b] remove references to forms Enderal 2.1 deleted or renamed, so xEdit and DynDOLOD load cleanly.
[/list]

[size=4][b]UI, controls and voice[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Controller Tweaks:[/b] adapts Complete Controller Setup to Enderal - the dead Quick Stats combo is unbound and SkyUI's sort buttons move off the equip and drop buttons.
[*][b]TrueHUD Combat Icons[/b] (SKSE plugin): For Honor Reforged's direction and status icons inside TrueHUD's enemy bar instead of floating above heads.
[*][b]IC Sheathe Fix and CCC Stand Down[/b] (SKSE plugins): no camera snap at the end of a first-person sheathe; Cinematic Conversation Camera stays out of Enderal's memory scenes.
[*][b]DBVO Player Lip Sync and DBVO Sex Defaults[/b] (SKSE plugins): your character's mouth follows each voiced line, and new games start on the voice matching your character.
[*][b]SIF Icons Above TrueHUD, Vel'dun RaceMenu[/b] and the [b]Vel'dun Reticle Arcs[/b] profile.
[*][b]Enderal Paired Animations and Creature Ragdoll Fix[/b] (Pandora): Enderal's six paired scenes play again, and skeletons get up properly after a ragdoll. Tick both in Pandora and rebuild.
[/list]


[size=5][b]Requirements[/b][/size]

[b]All patches:[/b] Enderal: Forgotten Stories Special Edition 2.1, SKSE for 1.7.104, Address Library.

Each patch also needs the mods it patches. The main ones:
[list]
[*][b]Most gameplay patches:[/b] EGO (Enderal SE - Gameplay Overhaul)
[*][b]Chocolate Poise patches:[/b] Chocolate Poise - Reforged
[*][b]Combat patches:[/b] For Honor Reforged, MCO / Attack_MCO, Dynamic Dodge, TK Dodge RE, Open Animation Replacer, Smooth Moveset, Precision, Dual Wield Parrying
[*][b]Flintlock Overhaul, Flame Shot, Reversal Shadow, Loop Pistol Animations:[/b] Enderal SE - Crossbows, Loop's Simple Pistol Shooting Animation, Ordo Legionis, KID
[*][b]Magic Patches, Kata Fixes, KataPUMB Affinities 2.1:[/b] KataPUMB, Apocalypse (Enderal version), Triumvirate - Mage Archetypes, xxOpenSpells
[*][b]Prophecy:[/b] Triumvirate - Mage Archetypes, SKSE Menu Framework, powerofthree's Papyrus Extender
[*][b]Traits:[/b] Biggie Traits. Its Goblin Slayer trait needs Zenderal - Goblins, which comes with the Wabbajack list
[*][b]Lost Ones Dismembering:[/b] Dismembering Framework, Lost Ones Revised, Undead Creatures Replacer
[*][b]Pretty Armory EGO Patch, Moonsteel Pretty Patch, Guard Falconer Patch:[/b] the Pretty Enderal Armory set
[*][b]High Poly Player Head:[/b] High Poly Head
[*][b]DBVO plugins:[/b] Dragonborn Voice Over, Cinematic Conversation Camera
[*][b]Controller Tweaks:[/b] Complete Controller Setup, Vel'dun UI
[*][b]Placement fixes:[/b] EPPI Riverville, Ark Bridge Overhaul, EPPI Improved Locations, ETATU, Perpetuum Theater, Water for Enderal CS
[*][b]Quieter Waterfalls:[/b] Reverb and Ambiance Overhaul - Enderal
[/list]

Using Zenderal through Wabbajack takes care of all of this.


